      "en": "Ascribe to the LORD the glory due to his name. Worship the LORD in holy array.",
      "ko": "여호와의 이름에 합당한 영광을 돌리며 거룩한 옷을 입고 여호와께 경배할찌어다",
      "source_text_hash": "1df6f7b3b1c8c7ca8166c0641b76214451c380a025ced9b0cff9025b36f86c1b",
      "translation_text_hash": "6ff43de7424c69a51923822ddeb94966695a70f2bb4e65ebea97120578c985c9",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
